error[E4003]: cannot move a value out from behind a reference
  --> tests/moves/fail/E4003_move_out_of_reference.tarn:16:12
   |
16 |     return b.data
   |            ^^^^^^ this moves a non-copy value out of a borrowed place
   |
   = note: a reference only lends the value; the owner keeps it
   = help: borrow it instead (`&...`), or work with a copy if the type allows it

